cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived software release."
title: "Comparative Acute Metal Toxicity in Marine and Estuarine Copepods: Reproducibility Code and Data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tanrıverdi"
    given-names: "Öykü"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/oykutanriverdi4-source/copepod-metal-toxicity"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - "copepods"
  - "acute toxicity"
  - "LC50"
  - "copper"
  - "cadmium"
  - "zinc"
  - "marine ecotoxicology"
  - "mixed-effects models"
  - "reproducible research"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code, curated analytical data, audit workflows, robustness
  analyses, and thesis-facing figures for a quantitative assessment of acute
  metal toxicity patterns in marine and estuarine copepods. The workflow
  integrates ECOTOX records with source-verified supplementary literature
  records and includes pooled, within-Reference, biological, environmental,
  covariance, and uncertainty analyses.
